    "detailed_description": "Use logic and planning to guide the kidnapped yeti through mind-bending puzzles. <br>Bend the unruly chickens to your will with kindness and fire.<br><br>The chickens operate in real-time by default, but the yeti can undo, reset, or freeze time at any moment for precise control requiring no dexterity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407090/extras/7b3e16c5282b8a3d233520dbc9c56676.poster.avif?t=1716420542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407090/extras/7b3e16c5282b8a3d233520dbc9c56676.webm?t=1716420542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407090/extras/7b3e16c5282b8a3d233520dbc9c56676.mp4?t=1716420542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore an open world of six different biomes as you unlock new areas by solving puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407090/extras/6a39704a1b4b4728d60ed0e019298edd.poster.avif?t=1716420542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407090/extras/6a39704a1b4b4728d60ed0e019298edd.webm?t=1716420542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407090/extras/6a39704a1b4b4728d60ed0e019298edd.mp4?t=1716420542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A yeti kidnapped by aliens<br></li><li>Some adorable chickens<br></li><li>Kindness<br></li><li>Fire<br></li><li>A helpful UFO<br></li><li>The Illustrated story of the alien chicken sanctuary</li></ul>",
